  Tempo: quarter note = 40
  Time signature: 4/4
  Key signature: D major

  The score uses two voices to preserve the sustained melody against the
  fingerstyle accompaniment. In bar 16 the final B-string fret 2 is shared visually by both voices in
  the source; it is written only in Voice 1 there to avoid a duplicate attack.
*/

